use frame/algebra/order/less-equal.tung
use frame/equal.tung
use ilk/three.tung
use ilk/two.tung

## a decidable partial order.
graiþ a less-equal
show frame a order-partial {
  law (a: a): a ≤ a ~ yea
  law (a: a, b: a): >(≤, a ≤ b, b ≤ a, a ≡ b) ~ yea
  law (a: a, b: a, c: a): >(≤, a ≤ b, b ≤ c, a, c) ~ yea
}

fill 𝟚 order-partial {}

fill 𝟛 order-partial {}

fill ℤ order-partial {}
